# Format: <relative path> <rule name>
# One violation per line; comments allowed.

# `ansible.mysql` and `community.mysql` are byte-for-byte identical
# (`ansible.mysql` is Red Hat's re-vendored fork). ansible-lint picks
# whichever is "first" as canonical; on machines with both installed it
# prefers `ansible.mysql`. The collection's published galaxy dep is
# `community.mysql`, so we keep that name everywhere.
